    "kind": "embedding",
    "x-notes": "imageEmbedding [1,512] and textEmbedding [B,512] are unit-length float32 (L2-normalized in the graph), so cosine similarity is their dot product. Zero-shot classification: softmax over labels of logitScale * cosine(image, text(label)); logitScale is upstream's logit_scale.exp(). OpenAI's prompt for ImageNet-style labels is 'a photo of a {label}.'."
  },
